    "detailed_description": "Two Putt is a mini golf party game where you control multiple golfers at the same time. Help Komakai and Kyoichi conquer 100+ courses and 20+ wacky mini games to become mini golf champions! \ud83c\udfc6 1-4 players<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546030/extras/e2e04479eafc32cc54420a2840f5fae9.avif?t=1739762830\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546030/extras/8f32deaee23b9f973657b3f8fb627227.avif?t=1739762830\" /></span><br><br>In single player mode, you control Komakai with the left joystick/left trigger, and Kyoichi with the right joystick/right trigger. Both must putt at the same time! In multiplayer mode, each player controls 1-2 golfers. All golfers on screen must putt at the same time, so make sure to coordinate with your team!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546030/extras/bc4825e8634ab2a30fea6e840e33f665.avif?t=1739762830\" /></span><br><br>There are 50+ wacky mini games interspersed between holes. Mini games can also be enjoyed standalone in Party mode!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546030/extras/71971568dd90a7e9e6ad57b0856ec117.avif?t=1739762830\" /></span><br><br>Dual joystick controllers are required for each player. Mouse and keyboard is not supported.",
    "about_the_game": "Two Putt is a mini golf party game where you control multiple golfers at the same time. Help Komakai and Kyoichi conquer 100+ courses and 20+ wacky mini games to become mini golf champions! \ud83c\udfc6 1-4 players<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546030/extras/e2e04479eafc32cc54420a2840f5fae9.avif?t=1739762830\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546030/extras/8f32deaee23b9f973657b3f8fb627227.avif?t=1739762830\" /></span><br><br>In single player mode, you control Komakai with the left joystick/left trigger, and Kyoichi with the right joystick/right trigger. Both must putt at the same time! In multiplayer mode, each player controls 1-2 golfers. All golfers on screen must putt at the same time, so make sure to coordinate with your team!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546030/extras/bc4825e8634ab2a30fea6e840e33f665.avif?t=1739762830\" /></span><br><br>There are 50+ wacky mini games interspersed between holes. Mini games can also be enjoyed standalone in Party mode!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546030/extras/71971568dd90a7e9e6ad57b0856ec117.avif?t=1739762830\" /></span><br><br>Dual joystick controllers are required for each player. Mouse and keyboard is not supported.",
